WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.377
Watch and read: While at the market, Ama thinks about this: Which word begins with a

00:00:05.377 --> 00:00:06.024
consonant blend?

00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:10.195
The answer is: brick. B and r are both heard in brick.

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:16.533
Watch and read: Kojo is learning with a partner at school. Which word begins with

00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:16.900
/st/?

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:22.564
The answer is: star. The sounds /s/ and /t/ join in star.
